@HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### Named operation with a stable target resource
GET {{HostAddress}}/projects/project-blue
Accept: application/json

### Bounded SyncMode dimension; quick and standard usually meet the 250 ms threshold
POST {{HostAddress}}/projects/project-blue/sync/quick
Accept: application/json

### Slow success: availability succeeds, latency threshold is exceeded
POST {{HostAddress}}/projects/project-red/sync/slow
Accept: application/json

### Health is not measured
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
